<title>USA: Lehman wins $200 mln Mass. Bay Transportation.</title>
<headline>Lehman wins $200 mln Mass. Bay Transportation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $200 million of Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority general transportation system bonds, 1997 Series A.</p>
